Carol: Oh yeah. I'm sorry. Of course. Course you can come in.

251
00:16:18,100 --> 00:16:20,500
桑迪:喔,这是你父母的房子?
Sandy: Wow, this is your parent's house hu?

252
00:16:20,500 --> 00:16:20,800
开萝尔:是的.
Carol: Yeah.

253
00:16:20,800 --> 00:16:22,400
桑迪:他们在吗?我很想见他们.
Sandy: Well, where are they? I'd love to meet them.

254
00:16:22,400 --> 00:16:30,800
开萝尔:哦,他们走了,我的兄弟也走了,每个人都走了.
Carol: Oh, they're gone. My brothers are gone. Everybody's...gone.

255
00:16:30,800 --> 00:16:44,400
桑迪:哦.
Sandy: Oh.

256
00:16:44,400 --> 00:16:46,300
麦琪:杰森,我要进去了.
Maggie: Jason, I am going inside.

257
00:16:46,300 --> 00:16:48,800
开萝尔:我的爸妈!藏到椅子后面.
Carol: My parents! Behind the chair.

258
00:16:48,800 --> 00:16:49,200
桑迪:什么?
Sandy: What?

259
00:16:49,200 --> 00:16:50,800
开萝尔:藏起来.
Carol: Hide.

260
00:16:50,800 --> 00:16:50,900
桑迪:为什么?
Sandy: Why?

261
00:16:50,900 --> 00:16:52,600
杰森:我待会进去.
Jason: I'll be in in a minute.

262
00:16:52,600 --> 00:17:01,300
开萝尔:因为我爸爸很疯狂,拿着把枪,哦,妈妈,你们怎么回家了?
Carol: Because my father's insane and he carries a gun. Oh mum. What are you doing home?

263
00:17:01,300 --> 00:17:07,600
麦琪:哦,车开不了了,等到修好恐怕看不了演出了.
Maggie: Oh, the car died and by the time we got it going we were too late for the play.

264
00:17:07,600 --> 00:17:09,000
开萝尔:哦,太可惜了.
Carol: Oh what a shame.

265
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:15,100
麦琪:哦,开萝尔,别告诉你的爸爸,我其实不介意是否看约 纳梅斯的<屋顶上的小提琴手>.
Maggie: Oh Carol, don't tell your dad, but I don't care if I ever see Jo Nameth Fiddler on the Roof.

266
00:17:15,100 --> 00:17:16,100
开萝尔:他在哪儿?
Carol: Where is he?

267
00:17:16,100 --> 00:17:20,500
麦琪:我想他正在舞台中央,唱着"如果我是一个有钱人".
Maggie: Oh imagine about right now, he's centre stage trying to sing "if I were a rich man".

268
00:17:20,500 --> 00:17:22,200
开萝尔:不,我是说爸爸?
Carol: No, I mean where's dad?

269
00:17:22,200 --> 00:17:30,800
麦琪:他在找汽修账单,我想那个机修师没有给汽车换新的火花塞,你爸爸正发火呢.要是他认为有人想占他便宜,他就会这样.
Maggie: Oh he's looking for the mechanics bill. I guess the mechanic didn't put new spark plugs in the car, and your father's fuming. You know how he gets when he thinks someone's trying to pull a fast one on him.

270
00:17:30,800 --> 00:17:32,800
开萝尔:哦,是的.
Carol: Oh yeah.

271
00:17:32,800 --> 00:17:36,500
麦琪:宝贝,我们出去时家里没开灯吗?
Maggie: Honey, was the house dark when we drove up?

272
00:17:36,500 --> 00:17:40,600
开萝尔:没有.
Carol: No, no.

273
00:17:40,600 --> 00:17:45,700
杰森:不在手套的格子里,我得去办公室看看.
Jason: It's not in the glove compartment. I'll be looking in the office.

274
00:17:45,700 --> 00:17:49,300
麦琪:杰森,别担心.你会要回你的钱的.
Maggie: Jason, don't worry about it. You'll get your money back.

275
00:17:49,300 --> 00:17:54,700
杰森:哦,那不是钱的问题,麦琪.是的,就是钱.但是我痛恨有人对我撒谎.
Jason: Oh, it's not the money Maggie. Yes it is the money. But I hate being lied to even more.

276
00:17:54,700 --> 00:17:57,600
麦琪:我得去看看克莉丝.
Maggie: I'm going to peek in on Chrissy.

277
00:17:57,600 --> 00:17:59,300
开萝尔:很遗憾车出问题了.
Carol: Sorry about the car dad.

278
00:17:59,300 --> 00:18:07,300
杰森:我只是替你妈妈感到遗憾,你知道她很喜欢约 纳梅斯.
Jason: I just feel sorry for your mother. You know what a Jo Nameth fan she is.

279
00:18:07,300 --> 00:18:10,500
桑迪:哦,你是对的,他真的是个疯子.
Sandy: Wow, you're right. He really is nuts.

280
00:18:10,500 --> 00:18:11,800
开萝尔:后门.
Carol: The back door.

281
00:18:11,800 --> 00:18:18,000
开萝尔:不,不,起来.
Carol: No, no. Get up.

282
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:18,800
杰森:开萝尔?
Jason: Carol?

283
00:18:18,800 --> 00:18:19,700
开萝尔:是的,爸爸.
Carol: Yeah dad.

284
00:18:19,700 --> 00:18:20,800
杰森:你在说什么?
Jason: Did you say something?

285
00:18:20,800 --> 00:18:21,700
开萝尔:没什么,爸爸.
Carol: No dad.

286
00:18:21,700 --> 00:18:26,300
杰森:哦.
Jason: Oh.

287
00:18:26,300 --> 00:18:33,100
开萝尔:哦,很抱歉,都是这些酸球糖.你还好吧?
Carol: Oh. Sorry about the sour balls. Are you ok?

288
00:18:33,100 --> 00:18:34,200
桑迪:我只想离开这儿.
Sandy: I just want to get out of here.

289
00:18:34,200 --> 00:18:35,700
麦琪:杰森,我去给我们泡些茶.
Maggie: Jason, I'll make us some tea.

290
00:18:35,700 --> 00:18:36,300
开萝尔:跟我来!
Carol: Come on!

291
00:18:36,300 --> 00:18:37,200
桑迪:门锁住了,钥匙在哪?
Sandy: It's locked. Where's the key?

292
00:18:37,200 --> 00:18:38,000
开萝尔:别慌.
Carol: Don't panic.

293
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:40,600
桑迪:哦,你说得容易,你父亲不会杀了你.
Sandy: Oh, easy for you to say. Your father's not going to shoot you.

294
00:18:40,600 --> 00:18:47,100
开萝尔:别站在那儿,他们会看见你.
Carol: Not there. They'll see you.

295
00:18:47,100 --> 00:18:48,100
麦琪:走廊很乱.
Maggie: This hallway's a mess.

296
00:18:48,100 --> 00:18:50,600
开萝尔:我让本打扫的.
Carol: I told Ben to clean it up.

297
00:18:50,600 --> 00:18:52,400
麦琪:你应该确认一下.你爸爸在哪呢?
Maggie: You sure will. Where's your father?

298
00:18:52,400 --> 00:18:54,600
开萝尔:在办公室里.我来扫,我来给你们泡茶.
Carol: In the office. I'll do that. I'll make you tea.

299
00:18:54,600 --> 00:19:01,300
麦琪:哦,很好,开萝尔.你没责任,很抱歉我们搅乱了你的周末.
Maggie: Oh that's ok Carol. You're off duty. Sorry we messed up your Friday night.

300
00:19:01,300 --> 00:19:03,500
开萝尔:哦,不,你们没有,一点也没有.
Carol: Oh no, you didn't. Not at all.

301
00:19:03,500 --> 00:19:06,100
麦琪:现在才八点半.如果你想的话你还可以出去.
Maggie: You know it's only eight thirty. You could still go out if you want to.

302
00:19:06,100 --> 00:19:07,500
开萝尔:哦,我很好.
Carol: Oh I'm fine. Just fine.

303
00:19:07,500 --> 00:19:20,200
杰森:啊!酸球糖.地上到处都是.
Jason: Ahhhhh! Sour balls. They are all over the floor in there.

304
00:19:20,200 --> 00:19:23,000
麦琪:哦,杰森!你没事吧?
Maggie: Oh Jason! Are you alright?

305
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:27,800
杰森:看,我找到了一张收条,都在这儿呢,六个新火花塞.看!
Jason: Look I found a receipt and it's all there. Six new spark plugs. Look!

306
00:19:27,800 --> 00:19:31,700
麦琪:杰森,我相信你.冲着机修师发火,别冲着我.
Maggie: Jason I believe you. Yell at the mechanic, not me.

307
00:19:31,700 --> 00:19:40,200
杰森:你知道谁惹火了我?这家伙以为我不注意.想一想,有人想占我便宜,而我就站在那.
Jason: You know what gripes me? The guy thought I wouldn't notice. Imagine the nerve of somebody trying to pull a fast one and me standing right there.

308
00:19:40,200 --> 00:19:44,100
开萝尔:爸爸,爸爸.我有一个办法.你去客厅,我泡茶给你喝.
Carol: Dad dad. I have an idea. Why don't you go into the living room, and I'll bring you your tea.

309
00:19:44,100 --> 00:19:48,400
杰森:你不能相信任何人.
Jason: You can't trust anybody anymore.

310
00:19:48,400 --> 00:20:03,600
桑迪:啊!请不要对我开枪.
Sandy: Ahhh! Please don't shoot me.

311
00:20:03,600 --> 00:20:16,600
开萝尔:你们茶里要放塘吗?
Carol: So do you guys want sugar in your tea?

312
00:20:16,600 --> 00:20:17,800
迈克:开萝尔,你究竟在做什么
Mike: Carol, what the heck are you doing...

313
00:20:17,800 --> 00:20:20,600
开萝尔:打你该死的英语论文.我说我会的,我正在做呢.
Carol: Typing your stupid English paper. I said I would, and I am.

314
00:20:20,600 --> 00:20:22,700
迈克:我还没写呢.
Mike: I didn't even start writing it yet.

315
00:20:22,700 --> 00:20:25,100
开萝尔:很好,我已经不能让任何人满意了.
Carol: Fine, I can't please anyone lately.

316
00:20:25,100 --> 00:20:29,200
迈克:你尝试一下女人的手段?
Mike: Look. Are you going through one of them female deals?

317
00:20:29,200 --> 00:20:32,500
开萝尔:我刚和爸爸妈妈大吵了一架.
Carol: I just had a major fight with mum and dad.

318
00:20:32,500 --> 00:20:32,700
迈克:哦,他们在家?
Mike: Oh yeah. Are they home?

319
00:20:32,700 --> 00:20:35,800
开萝尔:是的.他们让我回自己的房间,但是我不去.
Carol: Oh yeah. And they sent me to my room, but I refused to go.

320
00:20:35,800 --> 00:20:38,900
迈克:哦,所以他们知道你偷偷约了一个男人?
Mike: Oh, so they caught you with that guy that you were sneaking in.

321
00:20:38,900 --> 00:20:48,400
开萝尔:是的,我全对他们说了.酒吧,葡萄酒,牛,超速罚款单,酸球糖.你知道他们打算做什么吗?
Carol: Yes, and I told them about everything. The bar, the wine, the cattle, the speeding ticket, the sour balls. And do you know what they had the nerve to do?

322
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:49,500
迈克:不知道,什么呢?
Mike: No, what?

323
00:20:49,500 --> 00:20:51,300
开萝尔:他们关我三星期禁闭.
Carol: They grounded me for three weeks.

324
00:20:51,300 --> 00:20:53,300
迈克:我也这么想.
Mike: Well I guess so.

325
00:20:53,300 --> 00:20:54,600
开萝尔:什么?
Carol: What?

326
00:20:54,600 --> 00:20:59,800
迈克:来,开萝尔,一个他们总是信任的西维尔家的孩子,突然背叛了他们.
Mike: Come on Carol. The one Seaver kid that they can always trust just went over to the enemy.

327
00:20:59,800 --> 00:21:02,100
开萝尔:没有人十全十美.
Carol: Yow! Well nobody's perfect.

328
00:21:02,100 --> 00:21:07,100
迈克:没有人.
Mike: Not anymore.

329
00:21:07,100 --> 00:21:11,600
开萝尔:你说爸妈相信我,所以我闯了祸也和你不一样?
Carol: Are you saying that it's different when I mess up because mum and dad actually trust me, unlike you?

330
00:21:11,600 --> 00:21:15,200
迈克:是的,我很抱歉,我得去做家庭作业了.现在走了.
Mike: No. I'm sorry, I got homework to do. Now get out.

331
00:21:15,200 --> 00:21:17,100
开萝尔:你说得对.他们相信我.
Carol: You're right. They trusted me.

332
00:21:17,100 --> 00:21:18,000
迈克:嗯.
Mike: Uh hu.

333
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:21,100
开萝尔:他们总是相信我,现在我却对他们做了这样的事情.
Carol: They've always trusted me and now I do something like this to them.

334
00:21:21,100 --> 00:21:25,700
迈克:嘿.你可以去自己的房间唠叨吗?
Mike: Hey look. Could you go babble in your own room?

335
00:21:25,700 --> 00:21:28,100
杰森:迈克,你妈妈和我想和你妹妹谈谈.
Jason: Mike, your mother and I would like to have a word with your sister.

336
00:21:28,100 --> 00:21:28,500
迈克:好的.
Mike: Fine.

337
00:21:28,500 --> 00:21:29,300
杰森:单独谈.
Jason: Alone.

338
00:21:29,300 --> 00:21:31,500
迈克:把她带走吧.
Mike: Take her away.

339
00:21:31,500 --> 00:21:33,000
麦琪:你可以离开吗?
Maggie: Could you leave?

340
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:34,900
迈克:嘿,这是我的地盘.
Mike: Hey, this is my own apartment.

341
00:21:34,900 --> 00:21:37,300
杰森:你想待在这?
Jason: You want to keep it?

342
00:21:37,300 --> 00:21:45,200
迈克:是的,但是如果我完不成我的英语作业,你们要负责.
Mike: Right, but if I mess up my English assignment, it's on your heads.

343
00:21:45,200 --> 00:21:46,900
麦琪:开萝尔,我们去你的房间.
Maggie: Carol, we sent you to your room.

344
00:21:46,900 --> 00:21:51,800
杰森:如果你还这么大声音的话,我要关你三个月禁闭.我们继续中断的谈话吧.
Jason: And if you raise your voice, it will be three months grounding. Now let's go back to where we left off.

345
00:21:51,800 --> 00:21:52,700
开萝尔:我很抱歉.
Carol: I'm sorry.

346
00:21:52,700 --> 00:21:53,800
杰森:你不应该这样.
Jason: Well you should be young lady.

347
00:21:53,800 --> 00:22:00,100
开萝尔:我不想发火.我想我刚才生气是因为我不愿意相信我会和迈克一样,但是现在我确实更糟.
Carol: Look, I didn't mean to yell. I guess I was just angry because I didn't want to believe that I was as slimy as Mike, but now I see I was worse.

348
00:22:00,100 --> 00:22:01,200
杰森:是的,你理解了.
Jason: Yeah, well what you got to understand.

349
00:22:01,200 --> 00:22:07,200
开萝尔:我理解你们为什么对我发火.你们对我真的很失望,我辜负了你们的信任.
Carol: And I understand why you were yelling at me. I mean you were really disappointed in me. I've betrayed your trust.

350
00:22:07,200 --> 00:22:08,100
麦琪:是的,但是重要的是.
Maggie: Yes, but what's important here.

351
00:22:08,100 --> 00:22:26,800
开萝尔:我以前从来没有这样,至少不会这么严重,我想在这种情况下,我理解你们为什么关我三个星期禁闭.
Carol: And I have never done that before. At least not for something as serious as this. So I guess under the circumstances, I understand why you grounded me for three weeks.

352
00:22:26,800 --> 00:22:30,000
杰森:很好,我很高兴我们能有这次谈话.
Jason: Well uh, I'm glad we can have this little talk.

353
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:31,800
开萝尔:你想说什么吗?
Carol: You wanted to say something?

354
00:22:31,800 --> 00:22:36,300
杰森:嗯,我想现在我们已经没事了.
Jason: Uh, I think we've pretty much covered it now.

355
00:22:36,300 --> 00:22:37,800
开萝尔:我很难过.
Carol: I'm sorry.

356
00:22:37,800 --> 00:22:44,900
麦琪:哦,宝贝,没什么了.我不是说很好,我是说,你应该明白我的意思.
Maggie: Oh honey, that's ok. I mean it's not Ok. I mean. You know what I mean.

357
00:22:44,900 --> 00:22:52,200
杰森:希望你下次想约小伙子的时候,告诉我们.我是说……
Jason: And hopefully you'll let us know the next time you want to sneak a guy in. I mean...

358
00:22:52,200 --> 00:23:08,200
开萝尔:我知道你们的意思.妈妈,爸爸,不会再有下次了.相信我.
杰森:我想我们终于学会了如何做父母.
00:23:08,200
Carol: I know what you mean. And mum, dad, it won't ever happen again. Trust me. Jason: Well I think we are finally getting the hang of this parenting business.
